    "sections": {
        "description": "Hover Boards is a modern and responsive theme designed with a clean structure and organized layout for product-focused websites. The theme includes customizable homepage sections, product display areas, banner sliders, category listings, and integrated navigation options for easier browsing. It supports responsive design to ensure layouts adapt smoothly across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The theme also includes typography controls, color customization settings, and widget-ready sections for flexible content management. Additional features include social media integration, SEO-friendly code structure, fast-loading page layouts, and compatibility with common plugins for extended functionality. Hover Boards provides structured product presentation with image galleries, featured sections, call-to-action areas, and footer customization options. The layout is designed to maintain visual consistency while allowing content adjustments through the customizer. It also supports translation readiness and cross-browser compatibility for stable performance across different web environments."
    },
